Frontend Development Courses 🚀

Welcome to the Frontend Development Courses repository!
This repository contains learning resources, notes, examples, and practice projects for learning modern frontend web development from the ground up.

📚 Courses
1. HTML 🏗️

Learn the fundamentals of HTML (HyperText Markup Language) and how to structure web pages.

Topics include:

HTML document structure

Headings and paragraphs

Links and images

Lists

Tables

Forms and inputs

Semantic HTML

HTML5 elements

Audio and video

2. CSS 🎨

Learn how to style and design attractive, responsive web pages using CSS (Cascading Style Sheets).

Topics include:

CSS syntax

Selectors

Colors and backgrounds

Fonts and typography

Box model

Margins and padding

Flexbox

CSS Grid

Positioning

Transitions and animations

Responsive design

Media queries

3. JavaScript ⚡

Learn JavaScript to add functionality and interactivity to websites.

Topics include:

Variables and data types

Operators

Conditions

Loops

Functions

Arrays

Objects

DOM manipulation

Events

Form validation

ES6+ features

JSON

Fetch API

Async/Await

Local Storage

4. Bootstrap 🅱️

Learn Bootstrap, a popular CSS framework for building responsive and modern websites quickly.

Topics include:

Bootstrap setup

Containers

Grid system

Typography

Buttons

Cards

Navbar

Forms

Modals

Alerts

Tables

Responsive utilities

Bootstrap components

5. jQuery 💡

Learn jQuery, a JavaScript library that simplifies DOM manipulation, events, animations, and AJAX.

Topics include:

jQuery setup

Selectors

DOM manipulation

Events

Effects and animations

Classes and attributes

Form handling

AJAX

Traversing the DOM

jQuery plugins

